{
  "bookId": "hero-212005",
  "id": "bond-27537",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27537001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "家里变得好干净！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这些都是你打扫的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "赵云",
          "text": "真是惭愧，以前这些清洁工作，末将一炷香的功夫就够了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "赵云",
          "text": "塑料制成的身体，多少还是会给行动造成一些阻碍。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你已经做得很好了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "赵云",
          "text": "等一下，主公！\n快把身上的衣物褪下！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "赵云",
          "text": "您的白衣上沾了油渍！\n趁油渍未干，请速速脱下，由末将拿去清洗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……不用了，我用洗衣机洗就好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "赵云",
          "text": "主公千金之躯，这种小事哪用得着您亲自动手？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "赵云",
          "text": "食君之禄，为君分忧。以后这些事，全部都交给末将来做吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真的不用……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "赵云",
          "text": "这是现在这幅身躯的我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27537014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我知道了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
